Subject: [PATCH] Refactor SignatureHash, split into SignatureHashLegacy and
 SignatureHashBIP143. (#104)

This is to make it easy to add SignatureHashBIP341 later on.

Rebase provenance: this historical change was adapted onto the pinned
Bitcoin ABC base. Source diff is the recorded Lotus V1 replay commit below.

Historical-source-commit: f56136b741d738d108093ce438279e410586ec2f
Recorded-replay-commit: db00be7942507b671802b1ae8f3d637757edfd8a

